    "en": "Section 1."
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "The Sta. Ignacia-Guimba Provincial Road in the provinces of Tarlac and Nueva Ecija via Gerona-Pura Road stretching from Barangay Nambalan, Municipality of Sta. Ignacia to Barangay Buenavista, Municipality of Pura, all in the Province of Tarlac is hereby converted into a national road."
   }
